	(gr_text_box "- Aside from the 2A switches and solenoids on DSUB. \n	All other power outputs are not fused.\n	and should not exceed 2A combined on a singular rail.\n- All signal outputs (PWM/GPGPIO/SPI) are 3.3V.\n- USB C PWR to SBC USB will only power the RP2040 SBC.\n- Design GitHub Repo: cpspacesystems/nile-board-pmc"
